 "prop:differencecomplement": {
  "id": "prop:differencecomplement",
  "kind": "Proposition",
  "number": 35,
  "page": "16-complements.html",
  "title": "relative complement via complement",
  "statement": "<span class='m'><i>X</i> ∖ <i>Y</i> = <i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span>.",
  "proof": "<p>The inclusion criterion for <span class='m'><i>X</i> ∖ <i>Y</i></span> is <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>X</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∉ <i>Y</i></span>.\n\tThe inclusion criterion for <span class='m'><i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span> is <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>X</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>U</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∉ <i>Y</i></span>.\n\tSince <span class='m'><i>X</i> ⊂ <i>U</i></span>, we have <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>X</i></span> if and only if <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>X</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>U</i></span> by <a class='xref' data-ref='prop:subsetiffintersection' href='12-intersections.html#prop:subsetiffintersection' title='Proposition 14 (inclusion via intersection)'>Proposition&nbsp;14&nbsp;(inclusion via intersection)</a>.\n\tHence the two inclusion criteria are equivalent.</p>",
  "figure": ""
 },
