 "prop:demorganintersection": {
  "id": "prop:demorganintersection",
  "kind": "Proposition",
  "number": 36,
  "page": "16-complements.html",
  "title": "De Morgan, for intersection",
  "statement": "<span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i>)<sup><i>c</i></sup> = <i>X</i><sup><i>c</i></sup> ∪ <i>Y</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span>.",
  "proof": "<p>We will prove this by showing that the inclusion criteria are logically equivalent.</p><p>The inclusion criterion for the set <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i>)<sup><i>c</i></sup></span> is <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>U</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∉ <i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i></span>.\n\tUnpacking this further by the definition of intersection, the criterion is that (i) <span class='m'><i>x</i> ∈ <i>U</i></span> and (ii) it is <em>not</em> the case that <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is in both <span class='m'><i>X</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span>.\n\tEquivalently, <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is in <span class='m'><i>U</i></span> <em>and</em> either (i) <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is not in <span class='m'><i>X</i></span>, or (ii) <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is not in <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span>.</p><p>The inclusion criterion for the set <span class='m'><i>X</i><sup><i>c</i></sup> ∪ <i>Y</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span> is that <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is in either <span class='m'><i>X</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span> or <span class='m'><i>Y</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span>.\n\tThus, either (i) <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is in <span class='m'><i>U</i></span>, but not in <span class='m'><i>X</i></span>, or (ii) <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is in <span class='m'><i>U</i></span>, but not in <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span>.\n\tEquivalently, <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is in <span class='m'><i>U</i></span> <em>and</em> either (i) <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is not in <span class='m'><i>X</i></span>, or (ii) <span class='m'><i>x</i></span> is not in <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span>.\n\tBut we have seen already that this is the same as the inclusion criterion for <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i>)<sup><i>c</i></sup></span>.</p>",
  "figure": "<figure class='block fig' id='fig:demorgan' data-ref='fig:demorgan' data-open='1'><div class='figbody' data-toggle><div class='pic'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 72.4 42.4' role='img' class='figsvg'><defs><pattern id='demorgan-hNE' width='1.3' height='1.3' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M 0 1.3 L 1.3 0' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.15'/></pattern><pattern id='demorgan-hNW' width='1.3' height='1.3' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M 0 0 L 1.3 1.3' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.15'/></pattern><mask id='demorgan-m0' maskUnits='userSpaceOnUse' x='0' y='0' width='72.4' height='42.4'><rect x='0' y='0' width='72.4' height='42.4' fill='#fff'/><path d='M 10.2 21.2 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 30.0 0 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 -30.0 0 Z' fill='#000'/></mask><clipPath id='demorgan-c1'><path d='M 1.2 1.2 h 70.0 v 40.0 h -70.0 Z'/></clipPath><mask id='demorgan-m2' maskUnits='userSpaceOnUse' x='0' y='0' width='72.4' height='42.4'><rect x='0' y='0' width='72.4' height='42.4' fill='#fff'/><path d='M 32.2 21.2 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 30.0 0 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 -30.0 0 Z' fill='#000'/></mask><clipPath id='demorgan-c3'><path d='M 1.2 1.2 h 70.0 v 40.0 h -70.0 Z'/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path='url(#demorgan-c1)'><g mask='url(#demorgan-m0)'><rect x='0' y='0' width='72.4' height='42.4' fill='url(#demorgan-hNE)'/></g></g><g clip-path='url(#demorgan-c3)'><g mask='url(#demorgan-m2)'><rect x='0' y='0' width='72.4' height='42.4' fill='url(#demorgan-hNW)'/></g></g><path d='M 1.2 1.2 h 70.0 v 40.0 h -70.0 Z' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.18'/><path d='M 10.2 21.2 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 30.0 0 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 -30.0 0 Z' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.18'/><path d='M 32.2 21.2 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 30.0 0 a 15.0 15.0 0 1 0 -30.0 0 Z' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.18'/><text x='16.2' y='21.2' font-size='2.35' text-anchor='middle' dominant-baseline='central' font-family='Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif' font-style='italic' stroke='var(--fig-bg, #fff)' stroke-width='1.55' stroke-linejoin='round' paint-order='stroke' fill='currentColor'>X</text><text x='56.2' y='21.2' font-size='2.35' text-anchor='middle' dominant-baseline='central' font-family='Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif' font-style='italic' stroke='var(--fig-bg, #fff)' stroke-width='1.55' stroke-linejoin='round' paint-order='stroke' fill='currentColor'>Y</text><text x='6.2' y='6.2' font-size='2.35' text-anchor='middle' dominant-baseline='central' font-family='Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif' font-style='italic' stroke='var(--fig-bg, #fff)' stroke-width='1.55' stroke-linejoin='round' paint-order='stroke' fill='currentColor'>U</text></svg></div></div><figcaption><span class='lbl' data-toggle>Figure 15.</span> <a class='xref' data-ref='prop:demorganintersection' href='16-complements.html#prop:demorganintersection' title='Proposition 36 (De Morgan, for intersection)'>Proposition&nbsp;36&nbsp;(De Morgan, for intersection)</a>: the shaded region is both <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∩ <i>Y</i>)<sup><i>c</i></sup></span> and <span class='m'><i>X</i><sup><i>c</i></sup> ∪ <i>Y</i><sup><i>c</i></sup></span>.</figcaption></figure>"
 },
