 "prop:disjointunion": {
  "id": "prop:disjointunion",
  "kind": "Proposition",
  "number": 44,
  "page": "17-disjointness.html",
  "title": "a union of sets disjoint from Z is disjoint from Z",
  "statement": "For any sets <span class='m'><i>X</i></span>, <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>Z</i></span>, if <span class='m'><i>X</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>Z</i></span> are disjoint and <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>Z</i></span> are disjoint, then <span class='m'><i>X</i> ∪ <i>Y</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>Z</i></span> are disjoint.",
  "proof": "<p>By <a class='xref' data-ref='prop:distributivity' href='14-interactions-between-unions-and-intersections.html#prop:distributivity' title='Proposition 23 (intersection distributes over union)'>Proposition&nbsp;23&nbsp;(intersection distributes over union)</a>, <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∪ <i>Y</i>) ∩ <i>Z</i></span> = <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∩ <i>Z</i>) ∪ (<i>Y</i> ∩ <i>Z</i>)</span>.\n\tAs <span class='m'><i>X</i>, <i>Z</i></span> and <span class='m'><i>Y</i>, <i>Z</i></span> are both disjoint pairs, <span class='m'><i>X</i> ∩ <i>Z</i> = <i>Y</i> ∩ <i>Z</i> = ∅</span>, hence <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∪ <i>Y</i>) ∩ <i>Z</i> = ∅ ∪ ∅</span>.\n\tBy <a class='xref' data-ref='prop:unionempty' href='13-unions.html#prop:unionempty' title='Proposition 19 (uniting with the empty set)'>Proposition&nbsp;19&nbsp;(uniting with the empty set)</a>, <span class='m'>∅ ∪ ∅ = ∅</span>, therefore <span class='m'>(<i>X</i> ∪ <i>Y</i>)</span> and <span class='m'><i>Z</i></span> are disjoint.</p>",
  "figure": "<figure class='block fig' id='fig:disjointunion' data-ref='fig:disjointunion' data-open='1'><div class='figbody' data-toggle><div class='pic'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 60.4 22.4' role='img' class='figsvg'><defs><pattern id='disjointunion-hNE' width='1.3' height='1.3' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M 0 1.3 L 1.3 0' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.15'/></pattern><pattern id='disjointunion-hNW' width='1.3' height='1.3' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M 0 0 L 1.3 1.3' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.15'/></pattern><pattern id='disjointunion-hV' width='1.3' height='1.3' patternUnits='userSpaceOnUse'><path d='M 0.65 0 L 0.65 1.3' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.15'/></pattern><clipPath id='disjointunion-c0'><path d='M 1.1999999999999993 11.2 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 20.0 0 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 -20.0 0 Z'/></clipPath><clipPath id='disjointunion-c1'><path d='M 13.2 11.2 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 20.0 0 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 -20.0 0 Z'/></clipPath><clipPath id='disjointunion-c2'><path d='M 39.2 11.2 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 20.0 0 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 -20.0 0 Z'/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path='url(#disjointunion-c0)'><rect x='0' y='0' width='60.4' height='22.4' fill='url(#disjointunion-hNE)'/></g><g clip-path='url(#disjointunion-c1)'><rect x='0' y='0' width='60.4' height='22.4' fill='url(#disjointunion-hNW)'/></g><g clip-path='url(#disjointunion-c2)'><rect x='0' y='0' width='60.4' height='22.4' fill='url(#disjointunion-hV)'/></g><path d='M 1.1999999999999993 11.2 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 20.0 0 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 -20.0 0 Z' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.18'/><path d='M 13.2 11.2 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 20.0 0 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 -20.0 0 Z' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.18'/><path d='M 39.2 11.2 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 20.0 0 a 10.0 10.0 0 1 0 -20.0 0 Z' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='0.18'/><text x='8.2' y='11.2' font-size='2.35' text-anchor='middle' dominant-baseline='central' font-family='Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif' font-style='italic' stroke='var(--fig-bg, #fff)' stroke-width='1.55' stroke-linejoin='round' paint-order='stroke' fill='currentColor'>X</text><text x='26.2' y='11.2' font-size='2.35' text-anchor='middle' dominant-baseline='central' font-family='Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif' font-style='italic' stroke='var(--fig-bg, #fff)' stroke-width='1.55' stroke-linejoin='round' paint-order='stroke' fill='currentColor'>Y</text><text x='49.2' y='11.2' font-size='2.35' text-anchor='middle' dominant-baseline='central' font-family='Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif' font-style='italic' stroke='var(--fig-bg, #fff)' stroke-width='1.55' stroke-linejoin='round' paint-order='stroke' fill='currentColor'>Z</text></svg></div></div><figcaption><span class='lbl' data-toggle>Figure 21.</span> <a class='xref' data-ref='prop:disjointunion' href='17-disjointness.html#prop:disjointunion' title='Proposition 44 (a union of sets disjoint from Z is disjoint from Z)'>Proposition&nbsp;44&nbsp;(a union of sets disjoint from Z is disjoint from Z)</a>: if neither <span class='m'><i>X</i></span> nor <span class='m'><i>Y</i></span> meets <span class='m'><i>Z</i></span>, their union does not meet it either.</figcaption></figure>"
 },
